    "|-------|-------|--------|----------|\n",
    "| Bronze | 5 files | parquet, csv, json | `s3://data-lake/bronze/` |\n",
    "| Silver | 5 files | parquet only | `s3://data-lake/silver/` |\n",
    "\n",
